1
00:00:53,119 --> 00:00:54,159
Don't leave tonight.

2
00:00:56,079 --> 00:00:57,439
Come back and have a few more drinks with me.

3
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:01,679
Not tonight.

4
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:04,640
My mom is still waiting for me at home.

5
00:01:05,519 --> 00:01:06,760
At the celebration banquet,

6
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:08,680
I'll make sure to toast you properly.

7
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:10,799
Trying to tease me

8
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:12,159
without putting out?

9
00:01:14,319 --> 00:01:16,439
Let's see who's playing whom.

10
00:01:17,359 --> 00:01:18,159
Mr. Zhao,

11
00:01:18,879 --> 00:01:21,480
what about Ma Dawei's 14 apartments?

12
00:01:21,879 --> 00:01:22,760
What should we do?

13
00:01:26,519 --> 00:01:27,560
What do we do?

14
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,640
If he won't do it the easy way,

15
00:01:31,959 --> 00:01:33,319
he'll do it the hard way.

16
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,079
Chairman Shen,

17
00:01:46,319 --> 00:01:47,640
I really don't quite understand.

18
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:48,959
Jinhua Garment Factory

19
00:01:48,959 --> 00:01:50,599
faces bankruptcy and liquidation at any moment.

20
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:52,359
Even if you're scouting local investments,

21
00:01:52,359 --> 00:01:53,879
why choose a place like that?

22
00:01:54,079 --> 00:01:55,640
Is it because of that guy, Ma Dawei?

23
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:57,400
You don't think he'll pull it off either, right?

24
00:01:57,879 --> 00:01:58,519
Yes.

25
00:01:58,879 --> 00:02:00,599
He used your card to buy a house,

26
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,319
then offered a few pieces of clothing to settle the debt.

27
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:03,439
Isn't that just shameless?

28
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:07,000
The fabric of these clothes is indeed cheap,

29
00:02:07,159 --> 00:02:08,479
but the tailoring

30
00:02:08,479 --> 00:02:10,479
and its grasp of market aesthetics...

31
00:02:10,599 --> 00:02:11,800
Forget just locally,

32
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:14,000
it could easily compete nationwide.

33
00:02:14,439 --> 00:02:14,960
Linna,

34
00:02:15,919 --> 00:02:18,400
do you know what Yunding's next strategy is

35
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,000
after developing all these commercial centers?

36
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:22,400
Securing prime locations across major cities nationwide,

37
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:24,080
opening three to five

38
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:26,199
even larger integrated mega-mall clusters in each,

39
00:02:26,439 --> 00:02:27,639
to drive development in surrounding areas.

40
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:28,560
That's right.

41
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:30,439
If we want bigger malls,

42
00:02:30,439 --> 00:02:32,479
we need a much greater volume of merchandise.

43
00:02:32,719 --> 00:02:33,680
Yet right now,

44
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:35,280
the apparel counters across Yunding

45
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:36,759
rely entirely on southern suppliers

46
00:02:36,759 --> 00:02:38,199
or coastal export brands.

47
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,199
Simply put,

48
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:43,039
no matter how big our malls get, we're just landlords.

49
00:02:43,039 --> 00:02:44,479
If we want to take it further,

50
00:02:44,479 --> 00:02:46,479
we must take stakes in major apparel brands,

51
00:02:46,479 --> 00:02:47,639
and use our own channels

52
00:02:47,639 --> 00:02:50,319
to maximize the output value per square foot.

53
00:02:50,319 --> 00:02:51,000
I understand now.

54
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,960
Chairman Shen, you're playing a much bigger game.

55
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:55,400
Capital loves a story of integration.

56
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,719
I want the redevelopment land in North City,

57
00:02:58,080 --> 00:03:00,560
and I want Yunding's own clothing brand as well.

58
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:04,639
Go see Ma Dawei tomorrow.

59
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,479
Didn't he bring fourteen contracts

60
00:03:06,479 --> 00:03:07,599
to propose a partnership last time?

61
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:09,120
Ask him what kind of deal he has in mind.

62
00:03:09,759 --> 00:03:10,360
Yes, sir.

63
00:03:24,919 --> 00:03:25,919
Boss Ma,

64
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,280
we finally meet.

65
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,120
Mr. Zhao.

66
00:03:30,719 --> 00:03:31,759
Quite an entourage you've brought.

67
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,400
Anyone would think you're staging a robbery.

68
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,599
Cut the crap!

69
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:38,439
Mr. Zhao is doing you a favor by coming here in person!

70
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:42,639
Sign the transfer agreements for those 14 properties,

71
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:44,199
take the cash, and get lost!

72
00:03:45,879 --> 00:03:46,800
And what if I don't sign?

73
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:49,520
You're asking for it!

74
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,319
You punk!

75
00:03:57,919 --> 00:03:58,840
Keep him breathing.

76
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,479
Just as long as he can press his thumbprint.

77
00:04:00,759 --> 00:04:01,560
Stop!

78
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,680
What do you think you're doing?!

79
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:06,599
Special Assistant Lin!

80
00:04:09,759 --> 00:04:10,800
What brings you to North City?

81
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:11,960
Linna!

82
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,759
Perfect timing.

83
00:04:13,759 --> 00:04:15,000
If you were any later,

84
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:17,319
I'd have to file for worker's comp with Chairman Shen.

85
00:04:17,319 --> 00:04:18,319
You two know each other?

86
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,279
Zhao Gang.

87
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:20,959
Chairman Shen just warned you

88
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,639
that the North City project is crucial,

89
00:04:22,639 --> 00:04:23,720
and no conflicts are allowed.

90
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,920
Yet here you are, acting like thugs in broad daylight!

91
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:26,680
What?

92
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,879
You treat Yunding's bottom line as a joke?

93
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,759
Special Assistant Lin, you misunderstand!

94
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:34,399
This punk just doesn't know what's good for him!

95
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:38,079
I will report everything that happened today

96
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:39,439
truthfully to Chairman Shen.

97
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,720
Chairman Shen despises dirty tactics.

98
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,519
Today, you not only broke the rules,

99
00:04:43,759 --> 00:04:45,079
but you also crossed someone you shouldn't have.

100
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:48,600
Expect Yunding's termination notice tomorrow morning.

101
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,519
Wait!

102
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:50,800
Special Assistant Lin!

103
00:04:51,399 --> 00:04:52,879
Chairman Shen can't do this!

104
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:55,199
I fronted so much of my own money for this project,

105
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,319
plus all the loans!

106
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:58,040
You can't terminate the contract!

107
00:04:59,120 --> 00:04:59,680
Mr. Ma.

108
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:02,519
Special Assistant Lin.

109
00:05:04,439 --> 00:05:05,040
What happened today?

110
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,000
Chairman Shen can't do this!

111
00:05:06,079 --> 00:05:07,439
He just wanted to force my thumbprint

112
00:05:07,439 --> 00:05:08,519
to steal those 14 properties.

113
00:05:08,759 --> 00:05:09,639
And now I suspect

114
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:11,040
they've threatened other residents too.

115
00:05:12,079 --> 00:05:13,199
What's going on?

116
00:05:13,439 --> 00:05:14,600
How does he know Special Assistant Lin?

117
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,279
Go look into it, quick!

118
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,600
My Qianqian

119
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:24,360
is at Zhao's Construction now,

120
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:26,040
and what she says goes!

121
00:05:26,759 --> 00:05:28,360
Not like certain people

122
00:05:28,519 --> 00:05:30,120
messing around all day,

123
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:32,680
only to end up with nothing!

124
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,720
Isn't Dawei

125
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,639
at Jinhua Garment Factory lately,

126
00:05:36,639 --> 00:05:38,480
doing really well in business?

127
00:05:40,199 --> 00:05:42,160
That's just for show!

128
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,439
Who knows if he's just bragging?

129
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,519
In the business world,

130
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,839
things change quickly.

131
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:53,160
One careless move,

132
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,959
and you offend the wrong person.

133
00:05:55,279 --> 00:05:57,040
Even the most successful business

134
00:05:57,279 --> 00:05:59,040
can be wiped out overnight!

135
00:06:01,079 --> 00:06:02,759
"Offend the wrong person"?

136
00:06:03,759 --> 00:06:06,040
You don't mean that thug Zhao Gang, do you?

137
00:06:06,399 --> 00:06:06,959
What?

138
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:08,199
Ambushing people on the street

139
00:06:08,199 --> 00:06:09,040
and coercing deals...

140
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:10,680
That's what you call "legitimate business"?

141
00:06:10,879 --> 00:06:11,759
Bullshit!

142
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:13,920
How dare you call Mr. Zhao a thug!

143
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:16,160
You really don't know your place!

144
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,279
Ma Dawei,

145
00:06:17,639 --> 00:06:19,000
I warned you long ago:

146
00:06:19,439 --> 00:06:20,120
Mr. Zhao

147
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,240
is someone you can't afford to cross!

148
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,759
You insisted on being an ant shaking a giant tree,

149
00:06:23,759 --> 00:06:24,959
and now you see your mistake!

150
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:27,519
So I crossed him.

151
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:28,360
So what?

152
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,959
To me, Zhao Gang is just a crooked tree.

153
00:06:31,439 --> 00:06:33,399
Watch out, or you'll hang yourself on it!

154
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:34,360
You...

155
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,560
Stubborn to the end!

156
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:48,920
Hey, Brother Wei.

157
00:06:49,639 --> 00:06:51,720
What did you do to Ma Dawei?

158
00:06:52,439 --> 00:06:53,439
I was just about to ask you!

159
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,439
When on earth did Ma Dawei get to know

160
00:06:55,439 --> 00:06:57,199
Linna, the Special Assistant of Yunding Group?

161
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,959
Why didn't you report this to Mr. Zhao?

162
00:06:58,959 --> 00:07:00,800
He's got someone from Yunding backing him!

163
00:07:01,759 --> 00:07:02,920
Backed by Yunding?

164
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,040
Is that for real?

165
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,040
Feeling humiliated now?

166
00:07:07,759 --> 00:07:08,439
Brother Wei...

167
00:07:09,079 --> 00:07:11,160
Are... are you sure you're not mistaken?

168
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:14,639
Ma Dawei is just a broke liar.

169
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:16,079
Linna who?

170
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:18,399
How could he know someone from Yunding Group?

171
00:07:18,759 --> 00:07:20,279
Are you an idiot?

172
00:07:20,519 --> 00:07:22,680
If you want to die, don't drag Mr. Zhao and me down!

173
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,040
I'm telling you,

174
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,720
keep your eyes glued on him!

175
00:07:25,839 --> 00:07:27,360
Don't let him cause any more trouble.

176
00:07:27,959 --> 00:07:28,519
And another thing,

177
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:29,519
shut your damn mouth

178
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,680
and stay away from Ma Dawei!

179
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,199
I...

180
00:07:37,319 --> 00:07:38,160
You just said

181
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:40,439
I'm just trash in Zhao Gang's eyes.

182
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:41,560
Then...

183
00:07:42,079 --> 00:07:43,720
what does that make Zhao Gang,

184
00:07:44,079 --> 00:07:45,040
kneeling before trash?

185
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:46,120
Looks like their Mr. Zhao

186
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,759
is no match for our Dawei!

187
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:51,959
Mom,

188
00:07:52,399 --> 00:07:53,079
let's go.

189
00:07:53,399 --> 00:07:55,680
I still have to go to work this afternoon.

190
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:58,600
That's right.

191
00:07:59,079 --> 00:08:01,360
Look at our Qianqian's outfit.

192
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:02,639
She has officially

193
00:08:02,639 --> 00:08:04,839
entered the white-collar class.

194
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:06,600
Squabbling with you

195
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:08,600
would only lower her status.

196
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,160
Zhou Qian,

197
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,639
this outfit of yours...

198
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,399
This outfit?

199
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:17,199
It's trendy, high-end fashion,

200
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:19,199
made by a top designer!

201
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,040
I can tell, I can tell.

202
00:08:21,079 --> 00:08:22,160
What I mean is,

203
00:08:22,399 --> 00:08:23,720
that black silk scarf around your neck...

204
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,639
This?

205
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:28,360
It's all the rage in big cities now.

206
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:31,879
It's vintage French style!

207
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,000
No, no,

208
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:35,399
what I mean is,

209
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,720
that scarf wasn't meant

210
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:38,360
to be worn around your neck like a dog collar.

211
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:39,879
It's supposed to be pinned at the side

212
00:08:39,879 --> 00:08:41,679
as a belt to cinch the waist.

213
00:08:42,399 --> 00:08:43,759
Wearing it around your neck like that,

214
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:45,200
aren't you choking?

215
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,320
Ma Dawei, stop putting on airs!

216
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,399
What do you know about design?

217
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,919
If I'm not mistaken,

218
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:52,639
this outfit...

219
00:08:53,159 --> 00:08:54,240
was designed by me.

220
00:08:58,519 --> 00:08:59,399
Dawei knows how to design clothes?

221
00:08:59,399 --> 00:09:00,200
Ma Dawei,

222
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:02,159
Are you so broke you've lost your mind?

223
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:04,600
You? Designing luxury goods for department stores?

224
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:07,200
If you could design clothes for shopping malls,

225
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,720
then I

226
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,679
could build an atomic bomb!

227
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:14,960
How about

228
00:09:15,279 --> 00:09:16,559
we dump the cash out of the bag

229
00:09:16,559 --> 00:09:17,559
and show them?

230
00:09:17,559 --> 00:09:19,759
Let them see what real power looks like!
